    "en": {
      "trackName": "aa for Watch: Twisty Pin Game",
      "description": "A minimalist arcade game designed specifically for watches.\nTwisty Arrow challenges your timing and precision. Tap the screen to launch arrows into a rotating wheel, making sure they do not collide with existing ones. Each level becomes faster and more complex, pushing your reflexes to the limit.\nPerfect for short breaks, this game is easy to learn but hard to master. Clean visuals and simple controls make it ideal for quick sessions directly on your wrist.\nFeatures:\n\t•\tClassic needle insertion gameplay\n\t•\tOne-tap control, optimized for watch screens\n\t•\tIncreasing difficulty with unique level patterns\n\t•\tSmooth performance and offline play\n\t•\tDesigned for fast, satisfying gameplay anytime\nTest your focus and see how far you can go.",
      "releaseNotes": "",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/aa-for-watch-twisty-pin-game/id6757004617?uo=4",
